<h2 id="ir-s4" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">10. Procedure: step 4 — closing response to the user</h2>

When implementation stops (complete or blocked), reply with an **HTML table** summary (MRKD 6.1 pattern), for example:

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th style="padding:8px">Area</th><th style="padding:8px">Outcome</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:8px">Phases completed</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9;padding:8px">…</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:8px">Tests run</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9;padding:8px">…</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:8px">War stories</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9;padding:8px">New **#N** in <code>war_stories/WAR_STORIES.md</code> and/or <code>WAR_STORIES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC.md</code>, or explicit skip per phase (cite duplicate **#N** or trivial reason) — never blank without justification</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:8px">Plan file</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9;padding:8px">Final path after <a href="#ir-s3-move">step 3.5</a> (<code>cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/</code> vs <code>cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/</code>) + link to deferred table if any</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:8px">Blockers</td><td style="background:#ffebee;padding:8px">none or listed</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

Keep rows **concise**; link paths as full strings.

