<h2 id="ir-resume" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">11. <code>resumimpl</code></h2>

Treat **`resumimpl`** as: reload the **same** refactor plan (from **`cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/`** if relocated), confirm current **`[X]`** state, run **step 1** only if new ambiguity appeared, then continue **step 3** from the first incomplete checkbox. After each completed phase, run **step 3.4**; when the pass ends, run **step 3.5** and **step 4**.

---

<h2 id="ir-selfcheck" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">Self-check (agent)</h2>

- Plan path explicit or inferred once.
- MRKD-friendly plan structure before coding.
- Tests + comments + docs expectations visible **in the plan** before coding.
- No permission spam between phases; interrupt **only** for **§3.1d** true blockers — **not** for **§3.1c** forbidden excuses.
- After **each** phase: **read both** `war_stories/` collections → **exwar gate** → append **#N** or document skip (duplicate **#N** / trivial only); **same turn** as phase `[X]`. Closing summary **“War stories: none”** requires explicit per-phase skip lines—**not** “mechanism already in demos/code” and **not** “documented only in the plan/chat.” See **aciub** [§5 Exwar gate](aciub-allow-continue-iterations-until-blocked.mdc#aciub-exwar-gate).
- On close: Relocate plans per **[step&nbsp;3.5](#ir-s3-move)** — **`completed/`** only when phased implementable **`[ ]`** items are **`[X]`**, waived **with rationale**, or moved **out of phased lists** without misleading boxes; **`wip/`** when honest phased TODO boxes remain or blockers/session cuts apply.
- Final user reply is a **tabular** summary including **war stories** and **final plan path**.
